{"title":"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MadMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MadMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />th terms of all arithmetic sequences of integers that have first term equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and include both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d037f1aa313d30fe7ade693f1b672ed2a68880fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> as terms.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose we have an arithmetic sequence of integers that includes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d174dd02c50047be3d9e8d68549c95efa52759.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4, 24,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d037f1aa313d30fe7ade693f1b672ed2a68880fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The common difference of the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, must satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f277dd43869ae282886718168bb33965547f036.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d\\mid 24-4 \\text{ and } d \\mid 34-4 \\implies d \\mid \\text{gcd}(24-4, 34-4) = 10\\]\" width=\"447\" height=\"18\" /> \nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must be positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/1/6c1dea3049363574c86fcdc633c9ef0deab1a4a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=1, 2, 5, 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />. The 10th terms of each of these sequences is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af66e9c6d01bf828be9714749de258f5fcde9d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13,22,49,94$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"17\" />, respectively, so the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/8/3280bb23a2c064172aab2d1cb5a174ff68c771c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{178}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />.\n~sillybone\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MadMath\">Video Solution by MadMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MadMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/V2rcT0OTZBw\">https://youtu.be/V2rcT0OTZBw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II\" title=\"2026 AIME II\">2026 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2026 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2026\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2026 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018004143\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 134/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1774/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 133/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2153/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.605      1 -total\n 57.99%    7.889      1 Template:AIME_box\n 40.49%    5.508      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35462:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018004143 and revision id 284772. Rendering was triggered becaus